---
Title: a percent in a bare address
---

A percent-encoded address prints as written: see https://example.com/a%20b for
more, and <https://example.com/c%2Fd#part> in angle brackets, and
www.example.com/e%41 with no scheme.

In a footnote,[fn: at https://example.com/g%20h in a note.] in bold,
**https://example.com/i%20j**, and in a list:

- https://example.com/k%20l

## Heading https://example.com/m%20n

Unchanged: an address with no percent, https://example.com/p#q, and a link
written out, [the site](https://example.com/r%20s).
